flowchart LR
    entry[cmd/anki_as_code: composition] --> cli[internal/cli: syntax and streams]
    entry --> app[pkg/ankiascode.App]
    cli -. App .-> app
    entry --> api[ankiascodeapi: App and sources]
    cli --> api
    app --> api
    api --> schema
    cli --> schema[ankiascodepb: protobuf contracts]
    app --> schema
    entry -->|cgo enabled| nativeHost[ankigrpc/native.RunServer]
    entry -->|WASM enabled| wasmHost[ankigrpc/wasm.Run]
    app -. ServerRun / ServerServe .-> nativeHost
    app -. ServerRun / ServerServe .-> wasmHost
    nativeHost --> server[Child worker gRPC transport]
    wasmHost --> server
    app -->|path source| collections[collection.Store]
    app --> export[Export: write configs]
    app --> planning[Plan: prepare operations]
    app --> reconcile[Reconcile: execute plan]
    app --> builder[rebuild.Builder: stage and publish archive]
    planning --> resource
    app --> config[config.Store: Load, Dump, Export]
    app --> state[State: persisted bindings]
    cli --> codec[Codec: TOML and JSON]
    cli --> rpc[RPC: compiled Anki service catalog]
    rpc --> codec
    app -->|Prepare and invoke| rpc
    rpc -->|gRPC| server
    app --> resource[Resource: native clients and snapshots]
    export --> resource
    resource --> services[Generated Anki clients]
    export --> state
    export --> config
    config --> layout[Config layout]
    config --> codec
    layout --> codec
    reconcile --> state
    reconcile --> resource
    state --> services
    collections --> backend[Anki gRPC backends]
    backend -->|Launch same executable: server serve| server
    services -->|gRPC| server
    server --> native[Anki Rust backend: native or WASI]
